form). identity_classes: collapse classes (tier fact / derived) then heuristic candidate classes, each an IdentityClass with key = the display member's qname, members located and labelled, variants = distinct Some(content_key) among members (DD.2), `variant` per member = its index among them in member order (None without content); sorted by (tier rank, rules, key); filtered by tier / rule (unknown names -> Err naming the valid ones) / diverged_only; `limit` cuts after filtering (omitted = how many). Empty -> absence::empty(merged, "identity", ..., "no_match", note) with the note 'no SAME_AS edge: one repo with no shared package, message or contract op' or 'filters removed N classes'. Marker once per call: `[identity] report classes=<c> fact=<f> derived=<d> heuristic=<h> diverged=<x>`.

