` -> C::m {api: ApiService, b: Bar, n: "", d: "", rest: "", t: Repo, w: Widget, r: self.repo, q: Queue, u: "", it: "", e: "", x: Item}; f {svc: Svc}; g {h: Helper}. (b) a_name_bound_to_two_types_is_unknown - `export class R { shadow(api: ApiService) { const run = (api: AdminService) => api.purge(); } }` -> R::shadow api = "" and run = "". (c) inject_local_needs_the_inject_import - `import { inject } from '@angular/core';
export const guard = () => { const auth = inject(AuthService); return auth.check(); };` -> guard auth = AuthService; the same body with `function inject(t: unknown) { return t; }` and no import -> auth = "". (d) ts_locals_marker_counts - (a)'s class with body calls `api.x(); t.y(); w.z(); r.q(); u.v();` added -> LocalStats typed=4 (param=1 annotated=1 new=1 alias=1 inject=0), unknown=1. engine/tests/ts_local_receivers.rs (generate_one over tempdir copies; EVIDENCE read with Evidence::of): (e) fixture_binds_parameter_and_local_receivers - the fixture: the five expected CALLS, each EVIDENCE emitter graph:calls rule receiver_type at the call's 0-based report.ts row (loadReport -> ApiService::fetchUser 4, build -> ApiService::purge 11, build -> AdminService::purge 12, build -> ApiService::fetchUser 13, build -> AdminService::fetchUser 13); no CALLS from ReportBuilder::shadow to ApiService::purge or AdminService::purge (the name is unknown in that body); no CALLS loadReport -> AdminService::fetchUser. (f) a_parameter_shadows_a_same_named_field - `export class P {
