}` with the fixture's two services -> CALLS P::run -> ApiService::fetchUser, none -> AdminService::fetchUser. (g) constructor_parameter_still_binds (control, passes on HEAD) - `constructor(private api: ApiService) { api.fetchUser(1); }` -> CALLS P::constructor -> ApiService::fetchUser.
